titutions-line\">LES INSTITUTIONS PRIVÉES FAISANT APPEL A L'ÉPARGNE PUBLIQUE</div>\n\n      <div class=\"sommes-line\">SOMMES <span style=\"font-weight:normal; font-size:12px;\">RÉPARTIES AUX ADHÉRENTS PAR TIRAGES MENSUELS</span></div>\n\n      <table class=\"stats-table\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label-bold\" style=\"width:60%;\">CHAQUE ANNÉE</td>\n          <td class=\"plusde\">PLUS DE</td>\n          <td class=\"amount\">2 MILLIONS</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label-bold\">CAPITAUX <span style=\"font-weight:normal; font-size:11px;\">PAYÉS DEPUIS LA FONDATION</span></td>\n          <td class=\"plusde\">PLUS DE</td>\n          <td class=\"amount\">35 MILLIONS</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label-bold\">RÉSERVES <span style=\"font-weight:normal; font-size:11px;\">MATHÉMATIQUES</span><br>\n            <span class=\"small\">GARANTIE EXCLUSIVE DES ADHÉRENTS</span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"plusde\">PLUS DE</td>\n          <td class=\"amount\">140 MILLIONS</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"label-bold\">SOUSCRIPTIONS<br><span class=\"small\">RÉALISÉES</span></td>\n          <td class=\"plusde\">PLUS DE</td>\n          <td class=\"amount\">UN MILLIARD</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"shields-row\">\n        <div class=\"shield\">\n          CONSTITUTION<br>DE<br>CAPITAUX<br>\n          PRÊTS AMORTISSABLES<br>\n          SUR TITRES ET<br>HYPOTHÈQUES\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"center-brand\">\n          <div class=\"name\">LA SÉQUANAISE VIE</div>\n          <div class=\"sub-small\">SOCIÉTÉ ANONYME AU CAPITAL DE 12 MILLIONS</div>\n          <div class=\"line1\">COMBINAISONS NOUVELLES</div>\n          <div class=\"line1\">CONDITIONS LES PLUS LIBÉRALES</div>\n          <div class=\"line2\">GARANTIES ABSOLUES</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"shield\">\n          ASSURANCES<br>SUR<br>LA VIE<br>\n          RENTES VIAGÈRES<br>\n